  "summary_en": "European Commission White Paper proposing policy options for an 'ecosystem of excellence' (investment, skills, SMEs) and an 'ecosystem of trust' (a risk-based regulatory framework for high-risk AI with mandatory requirements, prior conformity assessment and governance). Includes product safety and liability concerns for autonomous cars and robotics. Opened for consultation until 19 May 2020.",
